                                p.fw-normal.text-secondary.read-more-content.collapsed The Qatar Financial Centre (QFC) has emerged as a regional FinTech hub in Qatar, supporting the country’s transformation into a digitally driven economy, as outlined in the Qatar National Vision 2030. In response to the rapid acceleration of global digitisation of trade, commerce and services, QFC has launched a series of innovative initiatives, including the QFC Tech Circle and QFC Tech Talk SeriesThe Qatar Financial Centre (QFC) has emerged as a regional FinTech hub in Qatar, supporting the country’s transformation into a digitally driven economy, as outlined in the Qatar National Vision 2030. In response to the rapid acceleration of global digitisation of trade, commerce and services, QFC has launched a series of innovative initiatives, including the QFC Tech Circle and QFC Tech Talk Series, that are designed to foster digital innovation, knowledge exchange, and entrepreneurship.<br><br> Companies in Qatar choose to set up with QFC to gain access to high-growth areas such as digital payments, SME-enabling technologies, InsurTech, RegTech and Islamic FinTech. With its business-friendly environment and regulatory support, QFC offers the ideal platform for local and international FinTechs seeking to scale across Qatar and the wider region.
